<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH SARA LEE UNIT 1996/97 NET UP 14 PCT.</title>
<headline>DUTCH SARA LEE UNIT 1996/97 NET UP 14 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in billions of guilders)</p>
<p>    Net profit			0.935  vs  0.820</p>
<p>    Turnover			 10.14   vs  9.50</p>
<p>    Operating Income		1.26   vs  1.12</p>
<p>Note -- Sara Lee is a fully-owned unit of Sara Lee Corp of the U.S., overseeing most of the conglomerates consumer products operations outside the U.S.</p>
<p>The company said it expected to see further growth in operating income during the 1997/98 financial year, barring unexpected developments in coffee and foreign currency markets.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
